Ang objective natin:

Router = DHCP Server + Inter-VLAN Routing
Core Switch = Layer 2 aggregation/trunking only
Access Switches = VLAN + port assignment + trunking

So essentially, aalisin natin ang SVI/gateway function sa CoreSwitch at ililipat sa Router-on-a-Stick.

                 ┌───────────────────┐
                 │       ROUTER      │
                 │                   │
                 │ DHCP SERVER       │
                 │ Inter-VLAN Routing│
                 │                   │
                 │ G0/0              │
                 └─────────┬─────────┘
                           │
                        TRUNK
                           │
                 ┌─────────┴─────────┐
                 │    CORE SWITCH    │
                 │                   │
                 │ L2 ONLY           │
                 │ NO SVI GATEWAYS   │
                 │ TRUNKING ONLY     │
                 └─────┬─────┬───────┘
                       │     │
                    TRUNK   TRUNK
                       │     │
                 ┌─────┘     └─────┐
                 │                 │
          ACCESS SWITCH 1     ACCESS SWITCH 2
          VLANs/Ports         VLANs/Ports

At yung telephony router mo puwede pa ring manatili sa topology. Hindi natin kailangang galawin muna iyon.

